          "id": 484,
          "field": "objective",
          "reason": "Current primary and secondary plus UA require6 Young Crocolisk Skins; refreshed installed Questie objective says4. Primary envChange explicitly says6 replaces4, but current live quantity not observed. Hold objective pending capture; no other dialogue field binds count.",
          "sourceEnglish": "Obtain 6 Young Crocolisk Skins for James Halloran in Menethil Harbor.",
          "rawDeepLProposal": "မေနသီလ်ဆိပ်ကမ်းရှိ ဂျိမ်းစ် ဟယ်လိုရန်အတွက် လူငယ်ကရိုကိုလစ်စ် အရေခွံ ၆ ခု ရယူပါ။",
